nncp (8.13.0-3rhizomatica1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add Unix socket proxy for shared TNC connection between daemon and
    nncp-call. Mercury/VARA only support one control client; nncp-call
    now routes through the daemon's existing connection automatically.
  * Add Dial() support to HFListener for outgoing calls via shared TNC.

 -- Rafael Diniz <rafael@rhizomatica.org>  Mon, 17 Mar 2026 14:00:00 +0000

nncp (8.13.0-2rhizomatica1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix hfmodem: persistent TNC connection across HF sessions.
  * Fix hfmodem: start control reader before sending init commands.
  * Listener-accepted connections no longer close shared TCP sockets.

 -- Rafael Diniz <rafael@rhizomatica.org>  Mon, 17 Mar 2026 00:15:00 +0000

nncp (8.13.0-1rhizomatica1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 8.13.0.
  * Add native HF modem transport (VARA/Mercury) for Hermes radio.
  * Add Hermes SHM PTT keyer and hamlib PTT support.
  * Built from Rhizomatica fork with hfmodem support.

 -- Rafael Diniz <rafael@rhizomatica.org>  Mon, 16 Mar 2026 12:00:00 +0000
